# SITL optical-flow + rangefinder setup — PHASE B (configure + point the EKF at flow).
# Values match ArduPilot's own Tools/autotest/default_params/copter-optflow.parm.
#
# Load AFTER phase A + reboot (so the RNGFND1_* params exist), THEN REBOOT AGAIN
# (the analog rangefinder backend only picks up RNGFND1_PIN on the next boot):
#   param load /Users/danieleamore/Studium/Drohnen-mit-KI/Pi-Code/params/sitl_flow_phaseB.parm
#   reboot
#
# Note: we do NOT touch SIM_SONAR_SCALE — its default (12.1212) already matches
# RNGFND1_SCALING (12.12). And we do NOT disable GPS: the EKF uses optical flow for
# horizontal position/velocity (POSXY=0, VELXY=OpticalFlow), while GPS still provides
# the origin/home so the geofence and "waiting for home" pre-arm are satisfied.
RNGFND1_MIN 0
RNGFND1_MAX 40
RNGFND1_PIN 0
RNGFND1_SCALING 12.12
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 0
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 5
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 0
